{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/05f374e49e349628edd6c506520d54d9.poster.avif?t=1757100424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/05f374e49e349628edd6c506520d54d9.webm?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/05f374e49e349628edd6c506520d54d9.mp4?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a Button. The level is your controller.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine  the buttons popped out of your controllers and  leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind <strong>One More Button</strong>. You play as the  circle button. To move around, you'll press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/38967e475cef4ec8d9293d390710e0e1.poster.avif?t=1757100424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/38967e475cef4ec8d9293d390710e0e1.webm?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/38967e475cef4ec8d9293d390710e0e1.mp4?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain-Melting Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to take a step back? The <strong>redo</strong> and <strong>undo</strong> buttons make retrying easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard controls! Move with WASD or arrow keys - but only if the button is available on the screen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/0b14d2ccf6dbe909c0a9d5ce76db32dd.poster.avif?t=1757100424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/0b14d2ccf6dbe909c0a9d5ce76db32dd.webm?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/0b14d2ccf6dbe909c0a9d5ce76db32dd.mp4?t=1757100424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a Beautiful Hand Drawn World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each packed with unique gimmicks and mechanics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"World 1 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623490/db6d65733ff3b4c57ea567f98132027c0d66a8d0.jpg"},{"name":"World 2 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623490/db6d65733ff3b4c57ea567f98132027c0d66a8d0.jpg"},{"name":"World 3 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623490/a91903dda3e6db982b24d6ae1194a5cd8b62509a.jpg"},{"name":"World 4 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623490/aef7ca7b8ac46e6ec2e97923ab2936d4c64738f4.jpg"},{"name":"World 5 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623490/aef7ca7b8ac46e6ec2e97923ab2936d4c64738f4.jpg"},{"name":"World 6 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam